{"$id":"yggdrasil/contracts/v1/restart_report","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"at":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"converged_rejoins":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"crashes":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"digests_exchanged":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"elements_transferred":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"full_reloads":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"nodes":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"checkpoint_elements":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"crashes":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"node_id":{"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{1,62}$","type":"string"},"rejoins":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"status":{"enum":["up","down","restarted"],"type":"string"}},"required":["node_id","status","crashes","rejoins","checkpoint_elements"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"policy":{"$ref":"restart_policy.schema.json"},"records":{"items":{"$ref":"restart_record.schema.json"},"type":"array"},"refusals_by_reason":{"additionalProperties":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"type":"object"},"rejoins":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"rejoins_refused":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"restarts":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"simulated":{"const":true},"version":{"const":1}},"required":["version","at","simulated","policy","nodes","crashes","restarts","rejoins","converged_rejoins","rejoins_refused","refusals_by_reason","digests_exchanged","elements_transferred","full_reloads","records"],"title":"RestartReport v1 — restart resilience at a moment: the policy judged under, every node's standing (up, down, or restarted-not-yet-rejoined) with its crashes, rejoins, and checkpoint size, and the totals — crashes, restarts, rejoins (and how many converged), refused rejoins counted apart by reason, digests exchanged, elements transferred by delta, and full_reloads, which stands at zero because this slice has no full-reload road; simulated is a constant — crashes and restarts are in-process losses of a replica, no